      "system": {
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>Choke: The scarf moves to choke the victim using one action. The target must make a @Check[type:will|dc:26|name:Suggestion|traits:mental,incapacitating,linguistic,necromancy,occult]save with the following results:&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Critical Success:</strong> no effect&nbsp;</li>\n<li><strong>Success:</strong> @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened}1&nbsp;</li>\n<li><strong>Failure:</strong> @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened}2&nbsp;</li>\n<li><strong>Critical Failure:</strong> @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened}2, @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed} 1.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The Scaf's next action is to strangle the target, who must make a @Check[type:fort|dc:22|name:Suggestion|traits:mental,incapacitating,linguistic,necromancy,occult]savevs 2d8+7 damage. This repeats until the target is dead or the scarf is disabled or broken.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"
