      "disable": "<p>@Check[type:diplomacy|dc:23|name: To Soothe Spirit|traits:complex,haunt] (trained) Twice To Soothe Spirit, @Check[type:religion|dc:20|name: To Quiet Spirit|traits:complex,haunt] (expert)&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">Twice </span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">To Quiet Spirit,&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>@Check[type:occultism|dc:20|name: To Quiet Spirit|traits:complex,haunt] (expert)&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">Twice </span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">To Quiet Spirit,&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>@Check[type:perception|dc:22|name: See Scarf|traits:complex,haunt] (trained) Once To See Scarf,</p>",
      "description": "<p>A horrific shriek fills the room as the scarf flies into the air.</p>",
      "reset": "<p>This Haunt automatically resets enter 1 day until the supernatural fungus in B37 is dealt with, even if the haunt was previously disabled.</p>",
